Well, that was an interesting experience.  I was just playing a
tourist, put on a ring of polymorph, and polymorphed into a
cockatrice.  I laid an egg, as I had lost my pet earlier, and tourists
seem to need pets early on.  Anyway, I eventually turned back to human
form, from timing out, not dying.  But everything I killed (with
Excalibur) still turned to stone, just as if I were still a
cockatrice.  No, it was not because my pet had touched them.  He was
nowhere near those things.  This seems to be a bug.  If it's not a
bug, it's sure a bizarre feature.

I died on the next level.  Soldier ants.  So the game is gone.  Unless
there's a bones file.  Wonder if the ghost will stone me when I find
it...

Note I am playing patchlevel 9, so maybe this is something that was
fixed in patchlevel 10.

